# Required. Get one at use.superdocs.app, or let an agent sign itself up:
#   curl -X POST https://api.superdocs.app/v1/agents/signup \
#     -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
#     -d '{"terms_accepted": true, "agent_name": "your-name"}'
SUPERDOCS_API_KEY=

# Optional. Overrides the API base, used by the test suite and for staging.
# SUPERDOCS_BASE_URL=https://api.superdocs.app/v1

# The calibration verifier (the second-reader check that infers a letter's
# strength band with no knowledge of what was declared) runs as a second,
# isolated SuperDocs chat call — it needs no separate key. It is available
# whenever SUPERDOCS_API_KEY above is set. Without a key at all, the app still
# runs and the deterministic lexicon checks still run; the UI states plainly
# that the second-reader check did not.
